  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dad, Tom, Lily, and Pip are in the park. They play a game. Tom has a ruler in his bag. Dad says what to do. \"Dad says: stand next to the tree.\" Tom and Lily stand next to the tree. \"Dad says: clap your hands.\" They clap. Pip runs and runs. \"Dad says: jump, jump, jump!\" They jump and jump.",
      "\"Dad says: kick the ball.\" Tom kicks the red ball. \"Dad says: point to the kite.\" Lily points to a blue kite in a tree. \"Dad says: read the board.\" Lily reads, \"No bikes.\" \"Dad says: ask a question.\" \"Dad, where is the ruler?\" asks Tom.",
      "\"Dad says: sit under the tree.\" They sit and look. Pip has the ruler! He sits under the tree with it. \"Pip, give it to Tom!\" says Lily. Pip gives the ruler to Tom. \"Good dog!\" says Dad. It is a fun game. Dad has a big smile."
    ],
    "summary": "Dad plays a game with Tom and Lily in the park. They kick, point, read, and ask a question, and Pip has the ruler.",
